description: Do not push, tag, or publish GitHub releases until the user explicitly asks
alwaysApply: true
---

# GitHub publish is opt-in

Do **not** push to `origin`, create or push tags, upload/clobber GitHub Release assets, or run `gh release create` / `gh release upload` unless the user clearly asks to publish, push, or ship a release in that message.

Commit locally only when the user asks to commit. Rebuild local Windows/Android/Wear artifacts as usual; keep them in `dist/` until a publish is requested.
